              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ile nusu waliopewa Waisraeli, ambayo Mose aliitenga na ile nusu waliyopewa wanajeshi waliokwenda vitani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
